    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an atmosphere of terror and loneliness as you try to find your way to salvation in an abandoned hotel full of secrets and eerie revelations. Beware of what lurks in the darkness and watch every step - there is no turning back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself trapped in a gloomy and long abandoned hotel. Every corridor is a test of endurance, every sound a reason to turn around. Find a way to escape by exploring depressing locations, unraveling sinister secrets of the past and avoiding lurking danger. Can you make it out before your mind fails you completely?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Realistic and oppressive atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Exploration of an abandoned hotel full of secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Psychological tension </p>",
